# The test bot's plan for The Slow Orbit (crates/openinn/tests/bot.rs). Around the airlock at
# (6, 0): an airlock deck running south, the lounge to the west with the galley and hold behind
# it, the cabins to the east, the med bay and the wash deck below them, the observation lounge
# south of the lounge, the hydroponics bay and the sim den to the south-west.
dig 6 1 airlock
dig 6 2 airlock
dig 5 1 lounge
dig 5 2 lounge
dig 4 1 lounge
dig 4 2 lounge
dig 3 1 galley
dig 2 1 galley
dig 3 2 hold
build 5 1 bar
build 4 2 table
build 3 1 printer
build 3 2 tanks
build 2 1 locker
# Night 2 and on, as credits allow.
build 6 1 charger
dig 6 3 airlock
build 6 3 scrubber
dig 7 2 cabins
dig 7 3 cabins
build 7 2 pod
build 7 3 pod
# The tourists come bored: an observation lounge.
dig 6 4 airlock
dig 5 4 viewport
dig 4 4 viewport
build 5 4 viewbench
dig 5 3 lounge
dig 4 3 lounge
build 5 3 table
build 4 3 table             # three tables together: a mess hall
dig 8 2 cabins
build 8 2 lamp              # a lamp by the pods: homely cabins
# The miners bring a rad dose and belt grime: a med bay and a wash deck.
dig 7 4 medbay
dig 8 4 medbay
build 7 4 medpod
build 8 4 gelsynth          # beside the pod: a triage bay
dig 7 5 spa
build 7 5 shower
dig 8 5 spa
build 8 5 planter           # beside the shower: fern steam
build 4 1 bar               # beside the first: a long bar
build 5 2 screen            # beside both counters: lit counters
build 4 4 starmap           # beside the bench: a window seat
build 6 2 charger           # two posts on the airlock deck: a charging bay
dig 3 3 hydro
build 3 3 hydrorack         # the mess tables are within two cells: garden tables
dig 2 3 hydro
build 2 3 greenbar
dig 8 3 cabins
build 8 3 scrubber
dig 6 5 airlock
build 6 4 planter
build 6 5 planter           # two planters near the mess table at (5, 3): a fresh-air lounge
dig 3 4 simden
dig 2 4 simden
dig 1 4 simden
build 3 4 arcade
build 2 4 arcade
build 1 4 arcade            # three in a row: an arcade row
dig 9 2 cabins
build 9 2 pod
dig 9 3 cabins
build 9 3 armchair
dig 4 5 viewport
dig 5 5 viewport
build 4 5 booth
build 5 5 lamp              # beside the booth: a lamplit snug
dig 9 4 medbay
build 9 4 scrubber
